<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Kwinten VDS 🐢</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #062b3d, #087f8c);
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 30px 20px 50px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 90px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 42px;
      margin: 5px 0;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .folder {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      border-radius: 25px;
      padding: 25px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    .folder h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .buttons {
      display: grid;
      gap: 15px;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }

    .button {
      display: block;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      background: white;
      color: #064052;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .button:hover {
      transform: scale(1.03);
      background: #dffcff;
    }

    .about {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 35px;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">

    <div class="logo">🐢</div>

    <h1>KWINTEN VDS</h1>

    <div class="subtitle">
      🐢 Schildpadden zijn mijn passie 🐢
    </div>

    <div class="folder">

      <h2>Welkom op mijn website!</h2>

      <p>
        Ontdek mijn website, muziek, Turtle World en CaluShop.
      </p>

      <div class="buttons">

        <a class="button" href="https://kwintenvds.be" target="_blank">
          🌐 Mijn website
        </a>

        <a class="button" href="https://suno.com/kwintenschildje" target="_blank">
          🎵 Mijn muziek
        </a>

        <a class="button" href="https://kwintenschildje.github.io/Turtle-World/" target="_blank">
          🎮 Turtle World
        </a>

        <a class="button" href="https://calushop.be/" target="_blank">
          🛍️ CaluShop
        </a>

      </div>

      <div class="about">
        <h2>🐢 Mijn passie</h2>
        <p>
          Ik hou van schildpadden en daarom staat de schildpad centraal
          in mijn projecten en mijn website!
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <footer>
      🐢 Kwinten VDS • Schildpadden zijn mijn passie
    </footer>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
